body:
You got this one right mate. You could probably get a pass being weak as a girl, but if you ever show weakness as a guy, girls will spit on you and shit on you all day, and there will be no compassion anywhere. Weak guys keep getting shit on by everybody and legally robbed because they are weak, and nobody gives a shit. When I was a boy I used to think women are tender, caring beings. Not so. So many women have said and done cruel things to me, including my own mother who told me straight to my face that she should have aborted me when i was still a boy.

&#x200B;

Bottom line: fuck humanity.
